WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.487
This query calculates average stay per patient using GROUP BY.

00:00:05.487 --> 00:00:09.147
The output has one row per patient.

00:00:09.147 --> 00:00:13.312
Individual admission rows are no longer present.

00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:18.292
That is correct when the desired output grain is patient level.

00:00:18.292 --> 00:00:21.112
GROUP BY collapses rows; PARTITION BY does not.

00:00:21.112 --> 00:00:28.352
That distinction lets you compute group totals, percentages, or rankings while preserving detail.

00:00:28.352 --> 00:00:37.512
For top-N-per-group problems, rank within each group first and then filter the ranked result in an outer

00:00:37.512 --> 00:00:38.560
query.
